  m_text: "<size=26><color=#ffa3fe>Magic Wild lands on reels 2 and 4 only and substitutes\nfor
    all symbols except <style=coinColor>Scatter</style>.\nWhen Magic Wild appears
    on reels, one of the followings\nis randomly triggered:\n\n<style=coinColor>-Stays
    the same\n-Expand up or down\n-Expand in both directions \n-Magic Wild clones
    the left adjacent\n symbol(s) to the right.</style>"
